1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:03,756
Alpha and power sound alike, but they answer different questions.

2
00:00:04,206 --> 00:00:08,793
Alpha is the cutoff you choose before looking at the data, commonly 0.05.

3
00:00:09,243 --> 00:00:13,424
Power is the chance of correctly rejecting a false null hypothesis.

4
00:00:13,874 --> 00:00:17,181
Each card and question shows the line of the notes behind it.

5
00:00:17,431 --> 00:00:19,735
Check it against your own notes with StudyProofs.
